# This vault OPTS IN to the habitat's shared link/path/orphan gates.
# Participation is declared, never inferred: a vault that appears in this directory is COUNTED by
# every gate, but only blocks one if it has agreed to be held to that standard. Without this, the
# arrival of turso.vault on 2026-09-04 silently reddened three shared gates for content whose
# owner had never opted in — and the alternative (a hardcoded vault list) is the stale denominator
# that made codeanchors.py blind to that same vault.
gates = backlinks orphans deadpaths anchors
